{
  "$comment": [
    "CANONICAL ACCOUNT-HOST REGISTRY — Phase UI-02 (ADR-016, ADR-017; UI/UX plan §4.1-§4.7, §6.2).",
    "",
    "This file is the SINGLE authority for the eight Servana account hosts. Every other",
    "representation is derived from it and is checked against it in CI:",
    "",
    "  config/account_hosts.php                         Laravel config (env-aware, cacheable)",
    "  resources/spa/src/host/accountHosts.generated.ts frontend typed registry",
    "  docker/nginx/account-hosts.generated.conf        nginx server_name allowlist",
    "",
    "Regenerate with:  node scripts/generate-account-hosts.mjs",
    "Verify with:      node scripts/generate-account-hosts.mjs --check",
    "",
    "The host selects the EXPERIENCE. It never grants identity, membership, tenant, branch,",
    "role, permission, MFA state or resource access (ADR-017). `requires_mfa` and `role_family`",
    "below are presentation/foundation metadata only — the authoritative MFA requirement stays",
    "MfaRequirementResolver and the authoritative role stays the database membership.",
    "",
    "Staging hosts are DERIVED from `domains.staging_suffix`, which is environment",
    "configuration (ACCOUNT_HOST_STAGING_SUFFIX). It must not be hard-coded elsewhere."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "domains": {
    "production": "servana.ke",
    "local": "servana.test",
    "staging_suffix": "staging.citruslabs.co.ke"
